      <title>捐赠肝脏可实现生物学年龄逆转</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/medtech/post/20260914/%E6%8D%90%E8%B5%A0%E8%82%9D%E8%84%8F%E5%8F%AF%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%AD%A6%E5%B9%B4%E9%BE%84%E9%80%86%E8%BD%AC/</link>
